==Battleground==
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
*2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Ackey]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[King Wahwah]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*5 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main boss of the stage, King Wahwah only appears at base magnification and he has many knockbacks making it possible to take care of the Shadow Boxer Ks and Mega Baa Baas without much interference. To do this, use [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] to snipe him. For the Ackeys, simply use [[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] which can OHKO them. Watch out though, as the Shadow Boxer Ks or King Wahwah can hit Supercar killing them quickly.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Iz the Dancer of Grief (Uber Rare Cat)|Iz the Lady of Mourning]]: She has Massive Damage against King Wahwah and Mega Baa Baa, as well as Colossus Slayer against the latter. Her 100% Shield Piercing dispatches of Ackey in seconds, and her Immune to Knockback means she can get close to King Wahwah and abuse his many knockbacks to basically stun-lock him. Just be sure to watch out for the Shadow Boxer Ks
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Kasa Jizo]]: Jizo destroys both Shadow Boxer Ks and King Wahwah. A large enough stack of them can abuse King Wahwah's high knockback count and juggle him to death while making quick work of the other enemies on this stage.

